cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
title: "runge-kutta-catalog: Runge-Kutta Butcher tableaux with original sources, order checks, and errata"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Giri
    given-names: Ram Chandra
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-7149-7938"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/rcgiri-physics/runge-kutta-catalog
abstract: >-
  823 Butcher tables read from 34 open-source ODE libraries at pinned versions,
  checked against the order conditions with physverify and to 50 digits, with a
  NodePy second opinion, and comparisons of 40 methods with their first
  published sources; and 88 Rosenbrock and W-method tables from 10 libraries,
  each linked to its source at a pinned commit, with the order for the exact
  Jacobian, the order as a W-method and the embedded order. Includes errata for
  published sources and confirmed library defects, and scripts that re-check
  every table.
keywords:
  - Runge-Kutta
  - Butcher tableau
  - Rosenbrock methods
  - W-methods
  - order conditions
  - ODE solvers
  - code verification
